      "line": 112,
      "start": 31,
      "end": 42,
      "source_quote": "右將軍到彥之自滑臺奔退",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "同年十一月。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "line": 119,
      "start": 49,
      "end": 60,
      "source_quote": "征南大將軍檀道濟引軍還",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "次年回軍。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "line": 142,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 23,
      "source_quote": "秋七月戊辰，以尚書王仲德為鎮北將軍、徐州刺史。",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "元嘉九年。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "line": 151,
      "start": 19,
      "end": 37,
      "source_quote": "鎮北將軍、徐州刺史王仲德加領兗州刺史",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "元嘉十年。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "line": 200,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 28,
      "source_quote": "夏五月戊辰，鎮北將軍、徐兗二州刺史王仲德進號鎮北大將軍。",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "元嘉十三年。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2370105,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/song005-ws2370105.wikitext",
      "line": 226,
      "start": 17,
      "end": 35,
      "source_quote": "辛卯，鎮北大將軍、徐州刺史王仲德卒。",
      "raw_sha256": "a8c2b67f4b5da1596c81b26e1c1bda24b8881d6f9508c2de613fb5f2453a5cca",
      "interpretation": "元嘉十五年五月。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "line": 21,
      "start": 53,
      "end": 69,
      "source_quote": "自言漢司徒允弟幽州刺史懋七世孫也",
      "raw_sha256": "3df8bb0cdbc5811a0747fcca3c9ed93d3b714bf0eee0315f6946eef8968fffdf",
      "interpretation": "宋書與殿本南史均保留自言的限定。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "line": 35,
      "start": 0,
      "end": 18,
      "source_quote": "元嘉三年，進號安北將軍，與到彥之北伐",
      "raw_sha256": "3df8bb0cdbc5811a0747fcca3c9ed93d3b714bf0eee0315f6946eef8968fffdf",
      "interpretation": "宋書本傳的原句，另與文帝紀對讀。"
    },
    {
      "revision_id": 2118581,
      "raw_path": "sources/songshu/songshu046-ws2118581.wikitext",
      "line": 37,
      "start": 60,
      "end": 83,
      "source_quote": "十三年，進號鎮北大將軍。十五年，卒，諡曰桓侯。",
      "raw_sha256": "3df8bb0cdbc5811a0747fcca3c9ed93d3b714bf0eee0315f6946eef8968fffdf",
      "interpretation": "宋書卒之前有十三年進號。"
    }
  ],
