      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "仲德少沈審有意略，事母甚謹，學通陰陽，精解聲律。",
      "reading": "仲德少沈審，奉母謹，通陰陽聲律；母未名。",
      "note": "仲德少沈審，奉母謹，通陰陽聲律；母未名。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-24",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "苻氏之敗，仲德年十七。",
      "reading": "在苻氏之敗時年十七，未明所指何戰。",
      "note": "在苻氏之敗時年十七，未明所指何戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 35,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-35",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "及兄叡同起義兵，與慕容垂戰敗，仲德被重創走，與家屬相失。",
      "reading": "王叡與仲德起兵，敗於慕容垂。",
      "note": "王叡與仲德起兵，敗於慕容垂。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 35,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "路經大澤，困未能去，臥林中。",
      "reading": "仲德臥林中。",
      "note": "仲德臥林中。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "有一小兒青衣，年可七八歲，騎牛行，見仲德驚曰：「漢已食未？",
      "reading": "青衣小兒約七八歲，呼仲德為漢。",
      "note": "青衣小兒約七八歲，呼仲德為漢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 106,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-106",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "「仲德言饑，小兒去，須臾復來，得飯與之。",
      "reading": "小兒取飯給仲德。",
      "note": "小兒取飯給仲德。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 106,
      "end_codepoint": 126,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-126",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "食畢欲行，而暴雨莫知津徑，有一白狼至前，仰天而號，號訖銜仲德衣，因度水，仲德隨後得濟，與叡相及。",
      "reading": "白狼銜仲德衣渡水，兄弟復相見。",
      "note": "白狼銜仲德衣渡水，兄弟復相見。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 126,
      "end_codepoint": 174,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-174",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "度河至滑台，復為翟遼所留，使為將帥。",
      "reading": "翟遼留仲德於滑台，使為將帥。",
      "note": "翟遼留仲德於滑台，使為將帥。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 174,
      "end_codepoint": 192,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-192",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "積年仲德欲南歸，乃棄遼奔泰山。",
      "reading": "積年，仲德往泰山。",
      "note": "積年，仲德往泰山。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 192,
      "end_codepoint": 207,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence1-207",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "遼追騎急，夜行忽見前有猛炬導之，乘火行百許裏以免。",
      "reading": "追騎甚急，猛炬導行百許里，沒有具名持火者。",
