      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence2-82",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "值玄篡，見輔國將軍張暢，言及世事。",
      "reading": "桓玄篡後，仲德見輔國將軍張暢。",
