      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 82,
      "end_codepoint": 99,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence2-99",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "仲德曰：「自古革命誠非一族，然今之起者恐不足以濟大事。」",
      "reading": "仲德向張暢論桓玄之舉。",
      "note": "仲德向張暢論桓玄之舉。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 99,
      "end_codepoint": 127,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "以仲德為鎮軍中兵參軍。",
      "reading": "劉裕任王仲德為鎮軍中兵參軍，與前句追贈亡兄分讀。",
      "note": "劉裕任王仲德為鎮軍中兵參軍，與前句追贈亡兄分讀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 11,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "武帝伐廣固，仲德為前驅，戰輒破之，大小二十餘戰。",
      "reading": "劉裕伐廣固，以仲德為前驅，大小二十餘戰。",
      "note": "劉裕伐廣固，以仲德為前驅，大小二十餘戰。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-24",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "盧循寇逼，眾議並欲遷都，仲德正色曰：「今天子當陽南面，明公命世作輔，新建大功，威震六合。",
      "reading": "盧循逼，仲德勸明公劉裕輔晉安帝。",
      "note": "盧循逼，仲德勸明公劉裕輔晉安帝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 68,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-68",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "祅寇豕突，恃我遠征，既聞凱入，將自奔散。",
      "reading": "仲德以遠征軍凱還立論。",
      "note": "仲德以遠征軍凱還立論。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 68,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "今日投草莽則同匹夫，匹夫號令，何以威物？",
      "reading": "若棄都即同匹夫。",
      "note": "若棄都即同匹夫。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 108,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-108",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "此謀若立，請從此辭。」",
      "reading": "若議定，仲德請辭。",
      "note": "若議定，仲德請辭。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 108,
      "end_codepoint": 119,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-119",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "帝悅。",
      "reading": "劉裕悅。",
      "note": "劉裕悅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 119,
      "end_codepoint": 122,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-122",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "及武帝與循戰于左裏，仲德功冠諸將，封新淦縣侯。",
      "reading": "左裏之戰後仲德以功封新淦縣侯。",
      "note": "左裏之戰後仲德以功封新淦縣侯。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 122,
      "end_codepoint": 145,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-145",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "義熙十二年北伐，進仲德征虜將軍，加冀州刺史，督前鋒諸軍事。",
      "reading": "義熙十二年416授征虜將軍、冀州刺史，督前鋒。",
      "note": "義熙十二年416授征虜將軍、冀州刺史，督前鋒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 145,
      "end_codepoint": 174,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-174",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "冠軍將軍檀道濟、龍驤將軍王鎮惡向洛陽，甯朔將軍劉遵考、建武將軍沈林子出石門，甯朔將軍朱超石、胡藩向半城，咸受統于仲德。",
      "reading": "分軍趨洛陽、石門、半城，皆受仲德統領。",
      "note": "分軍趨洛陽、石門、半城，皆受仲德統領。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 174,
      "end_codepoint": 233,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-233",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "仲德率龍驤將軍朱牧、甯遠將軍竺靈秀、嚴綱等開钜野入河，乃總眾軍進據潼關。",
      "reading": "仲德等開鉅野入河，進據潼關。",
      "note": "仲德等開鉅野入河，進據潼關。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 233,
      "end_codepoint": 269,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence4-269",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "長安平，以仲德為太尉諮議參軍。",
      "reading": "長安平，仲德任太尉諮議參軍。",
      "note": "長安平，仲德任太尉諮議參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 269,
      "end_codepoint": 284,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
