    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-025-wangyi:received_sentence6-15",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "qsd_v11_ya1_AA",
      "source_quote": "魏棄河南，司、兗三州平定，三軍咸喜，而仲德有憂色，曰：「諸賢不諳北土情偽，必墮其計。」",
